      "name": "CTFTCTE-STE-006 - Detect and decode linguistic steganography",
      "description": "Linguistic steganography hides the payload in the choice of words, not in the bytes that carry them. Work on the text as a sequence of decisions: first letters of each line, sentence or paragraph (acrostic), every n-th word, synonym substitution against a plausible baseline, or deliberate misspellings. Reconstruct the candidate string for each rule and test it against the expected flag format before trying the next.",
